# internal/platform/database/

The PostgreSQL connection pool and the migration runner live here: pool
construction and configuration, the readiness check that pings it, and the
Goose runner that applies `db/migrations/`.

This directory is empty today. `{{.AppName}}` has no database yet. When it
gains one, two seams are already waiting for it:

- `internal/app/app.go` builds the `health.Prober` from an explicit slice of
  checks. The pool's ping check is added there, as one more element.
- `runtime/observability`'s `PoolMetrics` accepts a `PoolStatsFunc`. The
  pool reports through it; nothing else changes.
